# Highly Available Web Application on AWS

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates how to deploy a highly available web application on AWS using core AWS services. The solution is designed to ensure high availability, automatic scaling, monitoring, alerting, secure access management, and audit logging.

---

## Architecture

```text
                Users
                  │
                  ▼
      Application Load Balancer
                  │
                  ▼
        Auto Scaling Group (ASG)
        ┌───────────────┐
        │   EC2 Server 1 │
        ├───────────────┤
        │   EC2 Server 2 │
        ├───────────────┤
        │   EC2 Server 3 │
        └───────────────┘
                  │
                  ▼
            Amazon CloudWatch
                  │
                  ▼
              Amazon SNS
                  │
                  ▼
           Email Notifications

CloudTrail ─────────► Audit Logs (Amazon S3)

IAM ────────────────► Secure Access Control
```

---

