## Business Requirement

A company hosts a web application and requires:

- High Availability
- Automatic scaling during traffic spikes
- Monitoring and alerting
- Audit logging of AWS activities
- Secure access management

---

## Project Objectives

- Deploy a web application on Amazon EC2.
- Distribute traffic using an Application Load Balancer.
- Automatically scale EC2 instances based on CPU utilization.
- Monitor infrastructure using Amazon CloudWatch.
- Receive email alerts through Amazon SNS.
- Secure AWS resources using IAM Roles.
- Track AWS API activities using AWS CloudTrail.

